            <title>[IGNITE-1017] ClusterGroup.forAttribute() accepts only String value</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1017</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Node attribute value can be an object of any type, but &lt;tt&gt;ClusterGroup.forAttribute(..)&lt;/tt&gt; method accepts only string as a value.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to add new &lt;tt&gt;public ClusterGroup forAttribute(String name, @Nullable Object val)&lt;/tt&gt; method and deprecate the existing one.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
